<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.4 bln bond due 2007 yields 6.275 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.4 bln bond due 2007 yields 6.275 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.4 billion auction of 7.25 percent bonds due June 1, 2007 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     6.275     107.434  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     6.269     107.482  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    6.280     107.394   66.85135</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on November 15. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$4.8 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$5,727.325 million, including C$59.325 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
